@startuml A1_layer_client
title Client Layer – User Interfaces

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #000000
  BorderThickness 1
}

rectangle "React Web App" as UI
rectangle "External Integrations\n(REST clients, tools)" as EXTERNAL

rectangle "Load balancer\n(optional in dev)" as LB

rectangle "Agent Service API\n(/api/v1/auth, /api/v1/chatbot, /api/v1/documents)" as ENDPOINTS

UI --> LB : HTTPS
EXTERNAL --> LB : HTTPS
LB --> ENDPOINTS : /api/v1/*

note bottom of LB
RAG / rag_graph are usually not exposed to\nclients; Agent calls them internally.
end note

@enduml


